window.products.push({"id":562010,"name":"CRANDDI Professional Blender,1500 Watt Commercial Blenders for Kitchen with 70oz BPA-Free Pitcher and Self-Cleaning, Countertop Blenders for Shakes an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GlLMSOEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ 1500W Blender ] CRANDDI Professional Blender has 1500 watt of motor, including auto shut-off smart technology, 24,000 RPM can crush ice quickly and easily, blending your favorite shakes and smoothies, juice, ice cream, frozen fruits, soups, sauces, grinding nuts and coffee, baby food, puree. [ 70oz Capacity ] CRANDDI countertop blender has large 70oz capacity (2 Liter/8 cups) for 5-6 people, designed specifically for blending up large quantities of smoothies, shakes, or other drinks. [ 10 Variable Speed ] CRANDDI blender YL-010 has 10 adjustable speeds and the knob can be smoothie adjust and rotate to any level. Pulse function help you to blend ingredients for few seconds only. The 6-leaf stainless steel blade and dual direction technology create a vortex blending effect for optimal performance. [ Healthy, Safety and Easy Cleaning ] CRANDDI pitcher is made of food-grade plastic. The pitcher sensor protects the engine and your safety. Self-cleaning help you release your hand, just add a drop of dish soap and water then pulse. [ 1 Year Warranty ] CRANDDI provide 1 year warranty and cups/ tamper/ cookbook and user manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GlLMSOEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRANDDI","source_asin":"B09Z6L2VJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z6L2VJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z6L2VJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":562011,"name":"Wusthof Limited Edition 200th Anniversary Carbon Steel 9-inch Chef's Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Iz-OahmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2014 marks Wusthof’s 200th anniversary and to celebrate Wusthof has released this 200th Anniversary 9 Inch Chef’s Knife. In 200 years time the name Wusthof has become synonymous with excellence the world over. The chef’s knife is the most used kitchen knife and essential to any kitchen. It’s made of forged carbon steel which is a fine-grain steel. Hardened to 59 degrees Rockwell, this steel will hold its razor-sharp edge well over time requiring infrequent sharpening. Carbon steel is not stainless steel and will develop a patina over time which is natural and will not impair its performance or affect your food. 200 years ago Wusthof knives were made of carbon steel making this knife the perfect means for Wusthof to celebrate their long history of working with steel. If you need your knives to be sparkling bright you might want to choose from Classic, Classic Ikon or Grand Prix II knives as they will continue to sparkle and shine. This knife is a limited edition, and an opportunity to own a piece of culinary history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Iz-OahmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00NOYG332","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NOYG332","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NOYG332","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
