window.products.push({"id":562063,"name":"ONAB Bath Mat - Quick Drying, Non Slip Bathroom Rug - Super-Absorbent Luxury Shower Mat with White & Black Marble Print for Toilet Floor, Bathtub, Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811aU0ud++L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frustrated by trails of water left behind after stepping out of the shower? Watery traces of footsteps on the floor isn't just a sight for sore eyes; it can also lead to accidents when somebody steps on them and slips. Having a bath mat waiting at the shower or bathroom door can help you avoid such scenarios, while at the same time saving you from the hassles of mopping and drying wet floors. The only question now is which toilet rug to use. After all, they're not always created equal. Some tend to get slippery in moist environments, while others become wet and soggy after only a few uses. That said, what you need is a mat that does its job well while solving the aforementioned problems. Keep your floors dry, clean, and safe with this Bath Mat from ONAB! Slippery bath mats are dangerous especially for kids and the elderly. This is why we've incorporated an effective anti-skid backing onto our mats. This keeps them stable and in place as you wipe your feet. The surface features a thick triple layer of cloth that doesn't just feel nice to the touch but also helps dry your feet faster. Despite the high water absorption rate, which is 2-4 times its weight, the mat dries pretty quickly. This means that there's less opportunity for mold and mildew to grow or develop. Aside from being effective, the bath mat looks absolutely gorgeous with its marble-like design. This makes it suitable for use not just in bathrooms, but also in more open areas like the hallway, front door, kitchen, or even in bedrooms. Here are more details about our bath mat: - Made with durable fabrics - Quality stitching prevents fraying - White and black marble design Make water trails a thing of the past. Add the ONAB Bath Mat to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811aU0ud++L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONAB","source_asin":"B09TQW6Z58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TQW6Z58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TQW6Z58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
