window.products.push({"id":562072,"name":"Elegear Lightweight Electric Hand Mixer, 250W 5-Speed Mixer Electric Handheld with 4 Stainless Steel Accessories (2 Beaters & 2 Dough Hooks), Handheld","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lTOI+Lx2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-Speed Adjustment & Turbo Button — The electric hand mixer has 5 speed gear selections, and a \"turbo\" button which can gradually increase the speed of each gear. With this electric handheld mixer, you can choose the speed (1 to 5) you want to handle all your mixing requirements. With the “turbo” button, it is convenient for you to change the speed for optimal mixing consistency when you are mixing. Lightweight Ultra Power Hand Mixer — Elegear electric hand mixer weighs only 2.2 lbs, Which is much lighter than most handheld mixers in the market. With this lightweight hand mixer, baking is no longer a tiring task for you and won’t take you too much energy. The 250W power makes it fast and easy for you to mix all ingredients you need for baking with one hand. Choose Elegear electric hand mixer, you can enjoy baking with ease and comfort! Durable Shockproof Stainless Steel Attachments — Our electric hand mixer includes 4 shock-proof, rust-proof stainless steel accessories: 2 dough hooks for mixing dough, and 2 mixers for mixing butter, egg whites, and other ingredients. This baking mixer is extremely suitable for daily cooking and baking. Made of high-quality stainless steel, these accessories have no coating peeling off in your food and won’t get rusty after long-time use. You can use this kitchen electric mixer without worries. Vertical Design & Eject Button — Most square-shaped hand mixer accessories in the market are difficult to be cleaned thoroughly. Our oval-shaped accessories are all dishwasher-safe and have no hidden corners for cleaning. To remove accessories from the kitchen electric mixer, just turn to speed 0, and press the eject button. The kitchen mixer comes with a storage rack! You can store all the accessories and the hand mixer vertically on the table to make your kitchen more beautiful and tidier. Good Heat Dissipation System — These multiple ventilation holes on the top and bottom of this electric hand held mixer can quickly dissipate heat and extend the handheld mixer's service life. Combining aesthetics, function, and practicality, our electric mixer can not only help you bake, but also decorate your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lTOI+Lx2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B08R6YKLRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6YKLRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6YKLRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
