window.products.push({"id":562203,"name":"AIRPLUS 30 Pints 2,000 Sq. Ft Dehumidifier for Basement, Powerful Dehumidifier for Home with Drain Hose (AP1907P)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IaiS19KVL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFICIENT DEHUMIDIFICATION: AIRPLUS dehumidifier efficiently removes moisture up to 30 pints in a room covering up to 2000 sq. ft (under RH90% @ 86℉ condition). With the humidity setting ranging from RH40% to RH80% and CO (Continuous Operation), it serves not only as a small dehumidifier for basements, but also a dehumidifier for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, kitchens, bathrooms, laundries, sheds and tiny houses. Just get room humidity under your control! 4 OPTIONAL MODES: AIRPLUS dehumidifier for home features four humidity modes, effectively meeting your diverse needs for dehumidification. Simply short press the MODE button and then the HUMIDITY button to customize your ideal humidity from RH40% to RH80% and CO (Continuous Operation) under STANDARD mode, or switch to another mode (DRYING mode with automatic CO status, RAINING and SLEEP mode respectively with default target humidity of RH45% and RH50%). Press and select as you please. QUIET OPERATION & TWO-WAY TIMING: AIRPLUS dehumidifier produces less noise when compared with its counterparts, protecting you from annoying disturbance whatever you are doing. Moreover, by pressing the TIMER button, you can preset the timing for auto-start or auto-stop from 1 to 24 hours according to your actual needs. The quiet operation makes sure you will not be distracted, while the two-way timing function saves precious time from redundant settings. FULL-TANK PROTECTION: When the water tank gets full, the AIRPLUS dehumidifier with drain hose will automatically stop working with the FULL indicator turning on and the unit beeping. Time to empty the tank! You can directly take out the water tank for draining or connect the dehumidifier to a floor drain with the accessory drain hose to leave the unit draining. The full-tank protection effectively prevents the unit from short circuit caused by the overflow of water. PORTABLE DESIGN: AIRPLUS basement dehumidifier measures only 11.2 * 6.6 * 19.6 inches, occupying less space in your room while efficiently keeping the room humidity at a certain comfort level. Equipped with 4 universal casters, this small bathroom dehumidifier can be moved anywhere effortlessly when protecting floors from being scratched. To remove moisture elsewhere, simply carry the whole house dehumidifier by holding the handle or nudge it to another room. Reminder: the Filter is embedded inside the Inlet Grid, so they are actually integrated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IaiS19KVL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airplus","source_asin":"B08ZJDRX5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJDRX5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJDRX5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
