window.products.push({"id":562370,"name":"Yumware Oven Gloves (Extra Large) #1 Heat Resistant Glove, Perfect for Cooking, Grilling, & Handling All Hot Items (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91K7IIuJjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Try Yumware Oven Gloves and you will be glad that you did! These gloves are the perfect solution to give you peace of mind when cooking, baking, grilling, taking hot items out of the microwave, they are even great for changing light bulbs! Whether you are cooking, baking, grilling, barbecuing, or microwaving, Yumware Oven Gloves work splendidly to protect your hands from any type of heat. These gloves are even flame resistant! They can handle heat up to 650 degrees F, keeping your hands safe from burns. These five-finger gloves are lined on both sides with special silicone stripes that provide you traction which gives you grip while handling any slippery object such as dishes. Designed to provide utmost comfort, these heat-proof gloves have a soft and plush interior feel. These gloves will surely make for the ideal accessory for your kitchen or outdoor grilling equipment. Use the yumware gloves to transfer hot pots from the kitchen to the dining table without fear of slipping, to remove steaming food out of the microwave, even to change light bulbs. Conveniently machine washable This is one purchase you will not regret having made! Product Features: * Withstands extreme heat up to 650F * Inside material has a very soft and comfortable feel * 5-Finger flexibility and seamless design with non-slip silicone grip * Can be worn on left or right hand and covers up to the wrist * Easy to store with attached loop hook, machine washable WARNING: Do not use the gloves when wet. If wet, remove immediately and dry before next use. Do not use over recommended temperature of 650 degrees Fahrenheit. Gloves do not offer indefinite protection against fire or extreme heat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91K7IIuJjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yumware","source_asin":"B00MXRBTJE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MXRBTJE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MXRBTJE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
