window.products.push({"id":562459,"name":"Ugly Christmas Sweater Cookie Cutter - LARGE - 4 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715XamnivZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW YOU CAN MAKE AMAZING MEMORIES AND COOKIES IN HALF THE TIME How an Easy To Use Cookie Cutter Can Cut Prep Time Down This Ugly Christmas Sweater Cookie Cutter turns your kitchen into a creative lab! Cut and decorate fun, clean shapes for your family and friends to enjoy! Baking can take time, a lot of time. But nothing takes longer than trying to look after the kids and clean up at the same time. Hit two birds with one stone and get them involved. With our safe and easy to use cookie cutters, the kids can help you make the cookies, biscuits, and fondant. What's better than one pair of hands? Two, or even three or four. Rope the kids into helping you in the kitchen, you can save time and spend some quality time with the kids. (BONUS; Baking keeps them busy and gives your partner a bit of a rest) Create some memories baking and decorating beautiful cookies and making funky shaped sandwiches, and teach them some responsibility as you do it. The cookie cutters have no dangerous sharp edges, the kids can cut the prep time down Once the treats are in the oven or lunch box, it's time to clean up (the worst bit). Don't worry, another convenient life lessons presents itself- teaching the kids to clean up after themselves. Simply run some warm water and gently screen the cutters until clean. Easy. Baking is be fun, baking with the family is memorable, baking with our cutters is easy. Happy Baking :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715XamnivZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cookie Cutter Kingdom","source_asin":"B014VTOZAG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014VTOZAG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014VTOZAG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":562460,"name":"Relaxzen 60-0500 Classic, Bonded Leather Recliner with Ottoman, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5+PkzX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Many recliners aren't much more than a chair that reclines backward. The 60-0500 Bonded Leather Recliner is truly a recliner from the ground up. Its unique design takes into account different body types and heights; and that you might sit differently when watching TV versus reading a book. Starting at the top, the thickly cushioned headrest adjusts upward to personalize how the neck and head are positioned and aligned. The entire seating design is distinctively contoured not only for comfort, but better support. Within the recliner's black bonded leather exterior is foam cushioning with recliner-specific foam density. The same applies to the matching ottoman, uniquely angled forward to fit the leg's natural curvature. Reclining to preference is fluid and effortless, thanks to a simple-access recline/lock mechanism. And its ultramodern, circular base is made of strong wood with extra cross support. It's the recliner that works better than expected, for a lower than expected price. Offered by Relaxzen, an early innovator in massage seating and part of Comfort Products family. With a history dating back to 1919, Comfort Products makes design and innovation affordable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5+PkzX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Relaxzen","source_asin":"B0746Z1W5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746Z1W5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746Z1W5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
