window.products.push({"id":562658,"name":"Bodum The de Chine 16-Ounce Glass Tea Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413U8QjiF+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Brew your favorite loose leaf tea with ease in the stylish The de Chine Teapot with glass infuser. Just put the tea into the infuser , add hot water, and let the tea steep to your liking. Because The de Chine is all glass, you can see the tea brewing, which allows you to let it steep just to your liking. Once it has finished brewing, just remove the infuser and serve. The lid acts as a trivet for the used infuser to eliminate drips on your table or countertop. The de Chine is made from heat safe borosilicate glass. The 2 cup size is 16 ounce and yields 2 - 8 ounce cups of tea. Amazon.com The impressively airy construction of the Bodum The de Chine glass teapot adds aesthetic pleasure to a functional design. A 2-cup vessel, the teapot features a generous infuser with narrow slits for drainage. The heat-resistant borosilicate glass is both safe in the dishwasher and lightweight in the hand, while its transparency ensures that tea does not steep beyond the desired strength. The handle on the de Chine is comfortable and large, and the entire pot is graceful on the move. It comes with a lid to retain warmth during steeping and serve as a trivet for the removed infuser. Standing 5 inches high, the piece measures 4 inches in diameter at the base and is intended for use with loose teas or herbal blends. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413U8QjiF+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B0000U6PT0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000U6PT0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000U6PT0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
