window.products.push({"id":562782,"name":"Dalbliy 7pcs Set Mini Dream Catcher, Car Interior Rearview Mirror Dangle Bag Pendant, Dream Catchers Cute Hanging Decor Nature Feather Small Boho Car ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TZVzA-rzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Beautiful Legend】Dreamcatcher comes from the 18th century. It is a traditional culture of Native Americans. Nightmares pass through the holes and out of the window. The good dreams are trapped in the web, and then slide down the feathers to the sleeping person. Therefore, it has the magical meaning of driving away nightmares, praying for peace, and bringing good luck. Let people fall asleep at ease, dreams come true. 【Unique Hand Designed】Our dream catchers are hand woven, they are all made with heart by experienced artisan. The material of the dream catcher is natural feathers, yarn and beads. Processed from natural materials into a beautiful dream catcher, it brings you the power of nature. 【Fashion Decor】Hanging bag, car ornament, home interior decoration, etc. 【Item Size】 Diameter of Circle: 1.18 inch/3cm; String Length: 3.15 inch/ 8cm. Beautiful design and multi colors for your choice, no matter where you choose to hang it, it will be the focus of attention. 【Best Gift 】The dream catchers is the best gifts for your lover, girlfriend, wife's wedding anniversary, child's birthday, mother's birthday, friend's birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day,Thanksgiving Day, Valentine's Day and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TZVzA-rzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalbliy","source_asin":"B097Z6CQSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097Z6CQSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097Z6CQSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
