window.products.push({"id":562814,"name":"Hessaire MC37V 3,100 CFM Evaporative Cooler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":384.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61st69O28XL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Evaporative cooling fans are designed to pull hot, dry air through a water-soaked media filter using a water pump and fan. As the water evaporates into the air, the air's temperature will lower. They are optimal when used in hot, dry climates used to filter ambient air while increasing the moisture and delivering cool airflow. Evaporative cooling fans do not use refrigerants to remove heat like an air conditioner, so they are less effective in high humidity areas. Hessaire’s MC37V is the best and most effective cooling fan on the market for its size. It’s compact and yet packs a powerful blast of cooling with a patented winged prop design and three panels of high-density rigid media. Take it on the go easily with its four casters. It features oscillating louvers to cover a wide area quietly and efficiently. The manual controls make it easy for you to adjust between the four temperature settings to obtain optimal cooling anywhere you take the MC37V Evaporative Cooler. Cooling the air is only a part of the process; propelling the chilled air into your space is what brings you needed relief. Specially engineered features from Hessaire allows this mobile evaporative cooler to provide an airflow of 3,100 CFM to your area. Proprietary fan propeller design with winglets throws the blast of cool air further and yet is very quiet. Additionally, the air swing delivery system moves cool air left to right across the room to ensure that air is evenly distributed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61st69O28XL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HESSAIRE","source_asin":"B07GBFYFSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GBFYFSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GBFYFSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
