window.products.push({"id":562853,"name":"Blue Jay Audubon Print Framed & Matted 17x16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FmbLmFBhL._AC_.jpg","description":"his is a professionally custom framed and dry-mounted print by John James Audubon from Birds of America. This print is a detailed high quality modern reproduction not an antique. John J. Audubon's paintings represent a revolution in the art of naturalist painting. Instead of painting from stuffed samples in a studio, he maticulously endeavoured to portray the birds as they are found in nature. His years spent traveling and studiying detailes of behaviour and plumage., and rendering them in the wild, resulted in a collection of stunning, multi-hued paintings in which the birds seem to come to life--a collection that earned him fame and fortune. Some of the best examples of his work are incorporated into these wonderful framed displays. ----Dry Mounting is the use of a dry tissue adhesive that is activated by heat from a heat press or an iron to bond artwork or a piece of fabric to a mounting board. The tissue is placed between the object to be mounted and the board. A high temperature is used to liquefy the tissue. Depending on the type of tissue used, the bonding occurs in the press or after removal.----","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FmbLmFBhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mysticmana.com","source_asin":"B0013GN89U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013GN89U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013GN89U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":562854,"name":"Cuisinart Whisk with ABS Handle, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DN3RS299L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cuisinart Whisk with ABS Handle, Red Amazon.com A staple tool that every cook should have on hand, this durable wire whisk whips up eggs for scrambling or gently combines ingredients for a stir-fry sauce. Designed to be functional as well as fashionable, its wires are made of high-quality 18/8 stainless steel, while the ergonomic handle is constructed of comfortable molded plastic with stainless-steel accents. For convenience, this whisk is dishwasher-safe and has an eye for hanging from a toolbar. This Cuisinart kitchen tool is covered by a five-year, limited warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DN3RS299L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B0006G0H8I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006G0H8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006G0H8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":562855,"name":"ShalinIndia Set of 2 - Home Decorations Lights Candle Holder Floral Arrangements","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TJ1N87UoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"During the Hindu holiday of Christmas, it is common place for Indian families to fill their home with beautiful Christmas lights called Christmas diya. These Christmas decorations may be used as Christmas puja or offerings or used beside temporary artworks called Christmas rangoli, which are produced from sand displayed throughout the celebration and then destroyed. It's also common to see Christmas candle holders placed on dinner tables and elsewhere throughout the home to fill an entire residence with Christmas decorative lights. This candle tea light holder was designed with these traditions in mind to serve as a beautiful piece of Christmas decor for the homes of Hindu families and allow everyone else to bring a beautiful Indian tradition into their own homes. This tea candle holder is an authentic Indian design produced by skilled artisans who reside in Kashmir, India. Constructed out of iron, the candle tea light holder has one candle tealight cup that is designed to hold a single candle with one or two candle tea light wicks. The cup has a lustrous gold finish and is surrounded by three wrought iron roses in a matching shade of gold. Textured leaves add realism to the design, and there are two large red resin faceted gemstones for added color and sparkle. The tea candle holder is meticulously crafted to ensure that every detail of its design is truly flawless and capable of standing the test of time. As a result, you'll be able to enjoy the beauty of one of these Christmas candle holders for years to come. Whether you're looking for a Christmas gift, something to add to your collection of Christmas decorations or tea lights holders to display every day in your home, you're sure to be impressed by the beauty and quality of our tealight candle holders. Order the Gold and Red Candle Holder for Tea Lights now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TJ1N87UoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B014IS7ZQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014IS7ZQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014IS7ZQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
