window.products.push({"id":562864,"name":"KanYool Over the Sink Strainer Colander Basket Collapsible Extendable Kitchen Food Fruits Vegetables Noodle Pasta Sink Drain Basket Retractable Plasti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hxv7sYNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KanYool over the sink strainers are made of high quality food grade material. It is BPA free, dishwasher safe, and heat-resistant up to 230° F/110° C. The collapsible colander strainer is durable and thick so it can accompany you for a long time. Besides, KanYool sink strainer basket can be adjusted to fit sinks of different sizes. It not only can be used as a plastic strainer basket to wash vegetable and fruits but also as a platter to hold fruits and snacks. With this expandable colander, you will gain a whole new cooking experience. Features : 1.High Quality Materials: Strainer colander basket is made of PP material, which provides safety,durability and flexibility. 2.Multiple uses: This extendable sink colander is suitable for rinsing. You can put the over the sink strainer to wash vegetables and fruits. The sink strainer colander also can be used as a basket basin on the counter.. 3.Suit for Most Sink: This extendable sink colander is adjustable and expands from 13.6 to 18.7 inches to fit most sinks. The colander strainer basket is smooth and easy to stretch. Which will offer you an excellent sense of use. 4.Easy Storage: Convenient eyelet for better storage, we specially added hanging eyelet when designing this product. You can hang this over the sink colander strainer basket anywhere after using Save space . 5.Easy Rinse: When you rinse your fruits and vegetables, our colander strainer plastic can help you hold them and prevent them from leaking Dry. 6.Good for Dry : When you wash tableware or other things that need to be dried, you can put them on this over sink strainer, which can help you dry them quickly. 7.Drain Quickly: The evenly spaced holes of the over sink colander make straining and draining easy and fast. It's portable for you to drain spaghetti, noodle, pasta and so on with colander strainer over sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hxv7sYNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KanYool","source_asin":"B0B5C5KGD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5C5KGD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5C5KGD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
