window.products.push({"id":562936,"name":"Aston & Arden Chenille Throw Blanket - 100% Ringspun Cotton All Season, Luxury Hotel Quality, Soft on Skin, Breathable, Heavyweight 400 GSM for Bed, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Fw08FpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM COTTON CHENILLE BLANKET: These luxurious throws and blankets are made from 60% Premium Ringspun Cotton and 40% Chenille. Premium Ringspun cotton is produced by spinning long-staple cotton fibers into superior, soft, and durable yarns. Chenille is made from high-quality medium staple cotton using a unique weaving technique, which makes it voluminous, puffy, and soft. Magnified, the chenille yarn looks exactly like what its name means in French: a fuzzy caterpillar! 5-STAR HOTEL QUALITY BLANKET: The striking design of the two-tone chevron weave in this soft, drapey cotton and chenille blend offers a plush comfort only found in 5-star hotel quality blankets. The unparalleled softness and handfeel of a cotton/chenille blend will give you restful relaxation and enhance your quality of sleep. BLANKETS FOR A LUXURIOUS BEDROOM: The two-tone design incorporates white chenille yarn woven with colored ringspun cotton yarn, creating a beautiful chevron pattern. Cocoon yourself in the luxe comfort of this inviting blanket while resting or relaxing in your favorite spot. Once you drape this heavy 400 GSM blanket around you, you will not want to take it off!! Settle in to your chair, sofa or bed and relax. COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: A cosmopolitan collection of rich earthtones, including Bay Blue, Fog Grey, Pistachio Green, Mushroom Brown, Buff Beige, and Pewter Grey. Make a bold decor statement in any room with an added layer of distinguished home textiles from this refined, all season color palette by Aston & Arden. SUPERIOR CHENILLE AND COTTON BLEND: The charming aesthetic of the chevron design betrays the richness of a hotel quality blanket. The chenille/cotton blend imbues this blanket with airiness and breathability as well as the heft and style of a high-end home decor textile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Fw08FpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BDH385J7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDH385J7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDH385J7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
