window.products.push({"id":562989,"name":"OneWorld Memorials Cottage Flower Ceramic Cremation Urn - Large - Holds Up to 200 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Blue Ceramic Urns - Engraving Sold Separatel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yQoFmGouL._AC_.jpg","description":"“Politeness is the flower of humanity.” – Joseph Joubert Can an urn resonate with a sense of politeness? With the graciousness of afternoon tea and the poise of a curtsy, these flower urns for ashes depict an art form of impeccable style and manners. Tasteful and aesthetically pleasing, the Cottage Floral Temple Cremation Urn evokes a dignity and respect resonant within a precious relationship. These unique urns invite one to savor memories while honoring a beloved.When you want to honor the dignity of the precious relationship you had with your loved one, the OneWorld Memorials Cottage Floral Temple Memorial Urn is an ideal choice. This traditional urn has a white background, with hand decorated designs on it in back of flowers and vines. The artwork delivers the same impeccable style that your loved one portrayed throughout life. Each urn can hold ashes equal to a body weight up to 200 pounds prior to cremation. A personalized engraving option is sold separately.Ceramics are made by combining earthenware ingredients, such as clay and powders, with water and molding them into desired forms. Often covered in a waterproof glaze, ceramic pottery is constructed in differing ways. Most often thrown on a potter’s wheel, it can also be hand molded into varied shapes and then fired in a kiln, first to harden the clay into pottery, then to set the glaze and bring out its vibrant colors. Glazes, only after firing, become the spectacular hues seen on each finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yQoFmGouL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B078JWS8TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-562989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JWS8TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JWS8TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
